{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_2.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Mysterious Nightmare!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nightmare Circus is an action-adventure game where the player takes on the role of a puppeteer trapped in the Nightmare Realm. As a member of a wandering circus troupe, you suddenly find yourself lost in an unknown land. You must fight enemies that wander the lands, save your fellow troupe members who are also stuck within this realm, uncover the mysteries of the realm, and make it back to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_3.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight like a Puppeteer!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key feature in the game is the \u201cPuppet String\u201d mechanic. The player can use the puppeteer\u2019s two puppet sticks as a weapon to fend off hostile enemies as well as the puppeteer's string to traverse, maneuver, and attack with our unique &quot;Collision Combat&quot; system. Employ an array of tools for creating satisfying collisions to smash, crash, and slam into enemies, obstacles, and danger; create your play style to deal with the many nightmares that roam the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_4.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Circus Awaits!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an eerie yet whimsical journey through the twisted realm of nightmares, unlock its mysteries, fend off the monstrous threats, and save your friends, becoming the bravest puppeteer the realm has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_1.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227900?t=1742288583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742288583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/40221d4a698ec5878a79c67c17183788ad0690b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742288583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/40221d4a698ec5878a79c67c17183788ad0690b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742288583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_2.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Mysterious Nightmare!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nightmare Circus is an action-adventure game where the player takes on the role of a puppeteer trapped in the Nightmare Realm. As a member of a wandering circus troupe, you suddenly find yourself lost in an unknown land. You must fight enemies that wander the lands, save your fellow troupe members who are also stuck within this realm, uncover the mysteries of the realm, and make it back to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_3.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight like a Puppeteer!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key feature in the game is the \u201cPuppet String\u201d mechanic. The player can use the puppeteer\u2019s two puppet sticks as a weapon to fend off hostile enemies as well as the puppeteer's string to traverse, maneuver, and attack with our unique &quot;Collision Combat&quot; system. Employ an array of tools for creating satisfying collisions to smash, crash, and slam into enemies, obstacles, and danger; create your play style to deal with the many nightmares that roam the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_4.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Circus Awaits!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an eerie yet whimsical journey through the twisted realm of nightmares, unlock its mysteries, fend off the monstrous threats, and save your friends, becoming the bravest puppeteer the realm has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/extras/NC_gifs_1.gif?t=1742288583\" /></p>","developers":["FairPlay Studios Co. Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227900/header.jpg?t=1742288583","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Nightmare Circus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-4350 or Intel Core i5-3470 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050